        "original_id": "d6dcbdbb-8938-5b58-8c89-7e90f1443d33",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Darwin Airline, Baboo, Aurigny Air Services, LIAT, Deloitte\n- Places: Lugano Airport, Bioggio, Lugano\n- People: Mark Darby\n- Roles: CEO, Head of Aviation Consulting\n- Topics: airline headquarters, passenger traffic, bankruptcy acquisition, airline branding\n\nFacts:\n- Lugano Airport handles around 200,000 passengers each year across about 2,400 flights.\n- In November 2010, Darwin Airline Group from Lugano acquired Baboo and saved the company from bankruptcy.\n- Darwin Airline SA is a Swiss regional airline with its head office in Bioggio, Lugano, and it flies under the brand name Adria Airways Switzerland.\n- The headquarters of Darwin Airline are located at Lugano Airport.\n- Mark Darby previously served as CEO of Baboo and LIAT and as Head of Aviation Consulting at Deloitte.\n- Mark Darby is CEO of Aurigny Air Services.",
